@startuml
title JSE - Enemy spawn and observer notification
actor Developer
participant ArenaScene as Scene
participant EnemySpawner as Spawner
participant "selected GameObjectFamilyFactory" as Family
participant World
participant EventBus as Bus
participant EventLogObserver as Log
Developer -> Scene : press 1
Scene -> Scene : select free position / check demo limits
Scene -> Spawner : spawn(world, request)
Spawner -> Spawner : validate request and world capacity
Spawner -> Spawner : createObject(request)
Spawner -> Family : createEnemy(request)
Family --> Spawner : ForestEnemy or SpaceEnemy
Spawner -> World : enqueueAdd(enemy)
World -> World : assign unique ID and queue object
World --> Spawner : queued (void)
Spawner --> Scene : enemy
Scene -> Scene : enemy.setBehavior(ChaseBehavior)
Scene -> World : commitChanges(tick)
World -> World : add to active collection
World -> Bus : publish(EntitySpawned)
Scene -> Bus : dispatchPending()
Bus -> Log : onEvent(EntitySpawned)
note over Spawner,Family
Spawner subclass chooses the product category.
Family factory chooses the coherent theme.
end note
@enduml
